OL,4,BGreece friendlies an opportunity to    
OL,5,Bbuild - Andrews                        
OL,6,GNorthern Ireland midfielder Joely      
OL,7,GAndrews said the upcoming friendlies   
OL,8,Gagainst Greece will provide an         
OL,9,Gopportunity to "embed an identity and  
OL,10,Gstyle of play" building towards next   
OL,11,Gyear's Nations League campaign.        
OL,13,FMichael McArdle's side host Greece at  
OL,14,FInver Park on 27 November and 1        
OL,15,FDecember with the double-header their  
OL,16,Ffirst friendlies in more than three    
OL,17,Fyears.                                 
OL,19,FNorthern Ireland are aiming to build   
OL,20,Fmomentum ahead of their challenging    
OL,21,FNations League B campaign against      
OL,22,FPoland, Finland and Belarus.      G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
