OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,BEnglish and O'Connor named athletes of 
OL,5,Bthe year                               
OL,6,GEuropean champions Mark English and    
OL,7,GKate O'Connor have been named joint    
OL,8,Gwinners of the Irish National Athlete  
OL,9,Gof the Year award.                     
OL,11,FEnglish became the first man to win a  
OL,12,Fgold medal for Ireland at the European 
OL,13,FAthletic Championship when he won the  
OL,14,F800m in Birmingham.                    
OL,16,FDuring another successful year, the    
OL,17,FDonegal athlete broke his own Irish    
OL,18,Findoor 800m record, set a new national 
OL,19,F1,000m record and also collected the   
OL,20,FMiddle Distance Athlete of the Year    
OL,21,FAward at the awards ceremony in Dublin.
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
